<title>USA: DENTSPLY International says CFO to retire.</title>
<headline>DENTSPLY International says CFO to retire.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DENTSPLY International Inc said on Wednesday that Edward Yates, the company's senior vice president and chief financial officer, had decided to retire from the company.</p>
<p>Yates will stay on, however, until his successor can be found, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>DENTSPLY designs and manufactures various products for the dental market.</p>
